    "terrainName": "indirect-fire-range",
    "description": "What: on indirect-fire-range a physical 'Blue Battery' (three M109s, 3.8 km back) is ordered ArtilleryUnitStrike, 6 rounds on (340,300), TimeOnTarget. A STOCHASTIC 'Red Platoon In The Open' (30 men) stands on the aim point; a second stochastic 'Red Platoon Clear' stands 600 m north of it, clear of the sheaf. Judge: (1) the guns fire and bursts land on the aim point; (2) the area sink hits the platoon in the open - a slot is down - and suppresses it; (3) the platoon 600 m away is never hit: not one slot of it loses health, it is never suppressed. Fail: no hit on the target, or a hit (health, suppression) on the platoon the rounds missed. Check: scripts/scenario-regression.sh agg-shelled-unit"
